{% extends "layout/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<section class="dest-page-hero" id="top" style="min-height: 40vh;">
  <div class="dest-page-hero__overlay" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0D0821 0%, #1a0d2e 100%);"></div>
  <div class="dest-page-hero__content">
    <h1 class="dest-page-hero__headline">Compliance & Disclosures</h1>
    <p class="dest-page-hero__sub">
      Transparency and trust are fundamental to how we operate.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dest-story" id="affiliate-disclosure">
  <div class="dest-story__inner">
    <div class="dest-story__text">
      <h2 class="dest-story__headline">Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        <strong>Earned Escape is an affiliate of Castle Dreams Travel.</strong> We operate under COTIB Adventures LLC, an independent travel planning company, and partner with Castle Dreams Travel to provide white-glove personal travel planning services backed by an established travel agency.
      </p>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        When you book a vacation through Earned Escape, you receive the personalized service of a boutique travel planner combined with the industry relationships and support infrastructure of Castle Dreams Travel. Your trip is coordinated with the same care I bring to planning my own family's vacations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dest-story" id="business-registration">
  <div class="dest-story__inner" style="flex-direction: row-reverse;">
    <div class="dest-story__text">
      <h2 class="dest-story__headline">Business Registration</h2>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        <strong>Earned Escape</strong> operates under the legal entity <strong>COTIB Adventures LLC</strong>, registered in New Jersey. This is my family business, built to serve you with the highest level of professionalism and care.
      </p>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        COTIB Adventures LLC is the business entity you'll be working with, and all services are provided under this company and its affiliate status with Castle Dreams Travel.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dest-story" id="communication">
  <div class="dest-story__inner">
    <div class="dest-story__text">
      <h2 class="dest-story__headline">Communication & Bookings</h2>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        All travel-related communication, reservations, and bookings are handled through Castle Dreams Travel email and systems. This ensures:
      </p>
      <ul style="margin-left: 1.5rem;">
        <li>Full compliance with travel industry regulations</li>
        <li>Access to real-time booking systems and supplier relationships</li>
        <li>Proper documentation and protection for your bookings</li>
        <li>Seamless coordination with cruise lines and travel suppliers</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        When we correspond about your vacation planning, we use Castle Dreams Travel systems while maintaining the personal, boutique service that defines the Earned Escape experience.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dest-story" id="errors-omissions">
  <div class="dest-story__inner" style="flex-direction: row-reverse;">
    <div class="dest-story__text">
      <h2 class="dest-story__headline">Errors & Omissions Coverage</h2>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        Castle Dreams Travel maintains Errors & Omissions (E&O) insurance that covers their travel operations. However, because Earned Escape operates under a separate brand and business entity (COTIB Adventures LLC), claim determination and coverage are at Castle Dreams Travel's discretion.
      </p>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        <strong>We are actively securing independent Errors & Omissions insurance coverage for COTIB Adventures LLC / Earned Escape.</strong> This will provide a dedicated layer of protection for your travel investment and ensure you're covered comprehensively. We're committed to having this in place to give you and your family complete peace of mind.
      </p>
      <p class="dest-story__body">
        Your protection and satisfaction are paramount. We operate with the highest standards of professionalism, accountability, and care.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dest-intro" id="questions">
  <div class="dest-intro__inner">
    <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Questions About Our Compliance?</h2>
    <p class="dest-intro__lead" style="text-align: center;">
      We believe in transparency. If you have any questions about our affiliate status, business structure, or how we operate, we're happy to discuss them.
    </p>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem;">
      <a href="{{ site.links.consultation }}" class="btn btn--gold">Schedule a Call</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-strip.njk" %}

{% endblock %}
